fidan-desktop (0.1.0~alpha5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Complete device setup in the desktop welcome; retain the legacy UI opt-in.
  * Carry appearance and region choices into the new account without repeating setup.
  * Repair browser desktop capture and add bounded authenticated diagnostics.
  * Include local SSH/browser access, optional RDP and Pi image tooling.
  * Expand desktop controls and preserve recovery copies for signed updates.

